                    <occupation>novelist</occupation>
                    <occupation/>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Godwin has relatively intense contact with Andrew Picken in 1832 and 1833 before
    his sudden death in 1833, and he is associated with him through Pickersgill's circle. The existence of a 
    number of 'Picken' entries after his death refer to <persName key="PIC03">Mrs Pickens</persName> and to her son<persName key="PIC04"> Andrew</persName>, an artist 
    who would have independent reasons for remaining close to the <persName key="PIC01">Pickersgill</persName> circle.</p>
